# Unicode CLDR 47, cldr-json cldr-dates-full/main/ko/ca-gregorian.json.
# days.format.wide, indexed from Monday.
#
# The abbreviated forms CLDR also carries are single syllables (일 월 화 수
# 목 금 토) and each is an ordinary word in its own right -- 일 is the day,
# the numeral one and Sunday at once, 월 is the month and Monday, 수 is a
# number and water, 금 is gold.  Nothing inside the phrase tells the readings
# apart; only a calendar grid does, and a grid is not prose.  They are
# therefore not shipped, and a bare abbreviation names no weekday here.
화요일
